# Proof Packet Template

Copy this template after completing a workflow, spec change, guardrail ratchet, or user-visible implementation. A proof packet records evidence already produced by local commands, docs, tests, or manual QA; it does not define new validator behavior.

````markdown
# Proof Packet: {Change Or Workflow Name}

## Summary

{One paragraph describing what changed and what evidence proves it works.}

## Profile

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Harness config | `docs/harness-engineering/harness-engineering.json` |
| Date | {date} |
| Author | {agent or human name} |
| Related workflow | `{path}` |
| Related spec | `{path}` |
| Stage impact | {none, visibility, advisory, shared gate, ratchet} |

## Changed Surfaces

| Surface | Path | Reason |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Docs | `{path}` | {why it changed} |
| Source | `{path}` | {why it changed} |
| Validation | `{path or command}` | {why it changed} |

## Evidence

| Check | Command Or Surface | Result | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Harness validation | `sh scripts/harness/validate_harness.sh` | {pass, warn, fail, not run} | {details} |
| Targeted test | `{command}` | {pass, warn, fail, not run} | {details} |
| Build | `{command}` | {pass, warn, fail, not run} | {details} |
| Manual QA | `{surface}` | {observed, not applicable} | {details} |

## Residual Risk

| Risk | Owner | Follow-Up |
| --- | --- | --- |
| {risk or none} | {owner} | {path, issue, or none} |

## Decision Notes

- {Non-obvious implementation or scope decision.}
- {Reason any validation was skipped or deferred.}

## Completion Statement

{State whether the change is ready for review, ready to merge, blocked, or informational only.}
````
